{"bookInfo":{"bookId":"42000009736","bookName":"Rey alfa, esta vez te rechazo","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000009736/42000009736.jpg@w=360&h=640","viewCount":1248684,"followCount":28812,"introduction":"Sara, una marginada sin loba, siempre ha amado a Gael, su pareja predestinada y el secreto rey alfa. Pero Gael cree que Olivia, su cruel hermana, le salvó la vida, por lo que elige a Olivia y lastima a Sara una y otra vez. Con el corazón partido, Sara rechaza su vínculo y se casa con Luciano. El día de la boda, Gael irrumpe en la ceremonia para conquistarla de nuevo, pero entonces, Sara se va para siempre, lo que hace que el rey alfa se enfrente a una vida de arrepentimiento.","chapterCount":60,"labels":["Werewolf","Love Triangle"],"tags":["Werewolf","Love Triangle"],"typeTwoIds":[357],"typeTwoNames":["Alfa"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":357,"name":"Alfa","replaceName":"alfa"}],"language":"SPANISH","typeTwoName":"Alfa","simpleLanguage":"es","bookNameEn":"Rey-alfa-esta-vez-te-rechazo","bookNameLower":"rey-alfa-esta-vez-te-rechazo","shelfTime":"2026-04-15 16:55:57","firstShelfTime":"2026-04-15 16:55:57","performerList":[{"performerId":"12028","performerName":"Tatyana Aravena","performerFormatName":"Tatyana-Aravena","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/8x2/12028/12028.jpg?time=1782797657617","videoCount":6}],"performerIdList":[12028]},"chapterList":[{"id":"700622422","index":0,"unlock":true,"mp4":"https://hwvideoseo.dramaboxdb.com/22/6x3/63x7/637x9/63790000024/700622422_1/700622422.720p.narrowv3.mp4?Expires=1795219200&Signature=ElM2tHfydKPheJ8TmqtmcfVfMdsi6U4YDDrVfKMTQrB26OE2utzu25CTOrSvSxIy-I66Vp9XMU0y9eqvXeyyAZhw4~XbNm6es~ywh~IMI95JwJtIo5pmmK97OOR2CmcF-apN5hDU-TmG53CCA3yzdcOezocMl4WW~lL49xDMHzKhrv-iqKf9OC12SSwkQTHw2qRgAa0d0ljd4wKYYL99tsvpYb2jbCvFMPQV-2z61H-v7EZesjBgxajLPgXjekLa~KgQQeuFOPnwLZsgfvJnWI~FBJKhTr7Py~3mBz8pUP~M2BeAXaikdYTlcSr0wXGbZ6Eu1CWqJHLv2EPRaozrVQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K3HA2TLE2QH99V","cove